# Files the CLI must not upload when deploying from the monorepo root.
#
# Vercel deploys both projects from here (each with its own Root Directory), so the whole tree is
# packed and sent. Without this list the upload carries local build and dev caches — a `next dev`
# turbopack cache and a Turbo cache blob here were each >100 MB, which trips the CLI's per-file
# limit and fails the deploy outright. They only appear after building locally, which is why this
# surfaced late rather than on the first deploy.
#
# Everything below is regenerated on the build machine (Vercel runs its own install, `uv sync`
# and build), so excluding it changes nothing about the deployed output — it only shrinks and
# speeds up the upload.

# JS deps + build output
node_modules
.next
.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo

# Python virtualenvs (Vercel installs from pyproject.toml + uv.lock)
.venv
__pycache__
*.py[cod]

# Tool caches
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache

# Never ship secrets, whatever the shape (mirrors .gitignore's deny-by-default rule)
.env*
!.env.example
